# D&D 5e 2014 — Official Sources and Expansions

Apply when session `edition` is **2014**. Follow `character-creator-research.mdc`; link the specific book for every option.

## Session source selection (ask before step 1)

After edition is confirmed, ask which **official sources** are allowed. Never enable a book silently.

1. **Core only** — 2014 PHB and/or [SRD / Basic Rules 2014](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/basic-rules-2014).
2. **Core + Expanded** — PHB plus official Wizards supplements (tables below).
3. **Core + Expanded + UA** — supplements plus Unearthed Arcana (label clearly; not for all tables).
4. **Custom list** — player/DM names specific books; **Other / custom (describe)**.

Record in JSON `constraints.sourceTier` and `contentSources`. Tag every option in chat and `character.md`.

## 2014 Core Rulebooks

| Book | D&D Beyond | PC options |
|------|------------|------------|
| Player's Handbook (2014) | [PHB 2014](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/phb) | 9 races, 12 classes, PHB subclasses, 13 backgrounds, feats (optional), spells, equipment |
| Dungeon Master's Guide (2014) | [DMG 2014](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dmg) | Optional rules, supernatural gifts, epic boons — DM approval required |
| Monster Manual (2014) | [MM 2014](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/mm-2014) | Beast companion stat blocks; mostly monsters |
| Basic Rules / SRD (2014) | [Basic Rules 2014](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/basic-rules-2014) | Subset of PHB — cite SRD when player lacks PHB |

