## TCoE subclasses and Artificer (expanded)

When TCoE is allowed — **Artificer** becomes available (Alchemist, Armorer, Artillerist, Battle Smith at level 3). Additional subclasses: Barbarian (Beast, Wild Magic), Bard (Creation, Eloquence), Cleric (Order, Peace, Twilight), Druid (Spores, Stars, Wildfire), Fighter (Psi Warrior, Rune Knight), Monk (Mercy, Astral Self), Paladin (Glory, Watchers), Ranger (Fey Wanderer, Swarmkeeper), Rogue (Phantom, Soulknife), Sorcerer (Aberrant, Clockwork), Warlock (Genie, Undead), Wizard (Bladesinging, Scribes).

Search + cite TCoE; use marketplace link if compendium unavailable.

