## Unearthed Arcana (optional tier)

Only if session tier **Core + Expanded + UA** or custom list includes UA.

- Source: [D&D Beyond UA](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/ua)
- Label every UA option clearly — **not legal for all tables**
- Many UA options were superseded by official books; prefer published version when it exists
- Never assume UA is allowed

## Presenting expanded options

- List options **only from allowed sources**
- Tag: `[PHB14]`, `[XGtE]`, `[MotM]`, etc.
- **Feats:** PHB feats + XGtE/TCoE feats if those books allowed; confirm feats optional rule is in use
- **TCoE Custom Lineage / Customizing Origin:** optional rules — ask before using

